# ==============================================================================
# Spotify Web Player Cookie Template (sp_dc)
# ==============================================================================
# To enable Spotify Canvas video loop playback on MacLock:
#
# 1. Open https://open.spotify.com in your web browser (Chrome, Chromium, Firefox, etc.)
#    and ensure you are logged into your Spotify account.
# 2. Open Developer Tools: Press F12 (or right-click -> Inspect).
# 3. Navigate to:
#    - Chrome / Chromium / Edge / Brave: "Application" tab -> "Cookies" -> "https://open.spotify.com"
#    - Firefox: "Storage" tab -> "Cookies" -> "https://open.spotify.com"
# 4. Locate the cookie named: sp_dc
# 5. Copy its long alphanumeric value.
# 6. Save your cookie into ~/.config/maclock/sp_dc (do NOT commit this file to git!):
#
#    mkdir -p ~/.config/maclock
#    echo "YOUR_SP_DC_COOKIE_HERE" > ~/.config/maclock/sp_dc
#    chmod 600 ~/.config/maclock/sp_dc
#
# Once saved, MacLock will automatically fetch and loop Canvas videos for supported songs!
# ==============================================================================
